<title>UK: J.P. Morgan prices $400 mln asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan prices $400 mln asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager J.P. Morgan, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST BANK CORPORATE CARD MASTER TRUST SERIES 1997-1</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT    $394.8 MLN    COUPON     6.4 PCT   LEGAL MAT   15.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.87723  PAY DATE   S27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.87723  SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
